AppContainer network mode:
• "Full network block" — without the internetClient capability all traffic is closed (outbound/inbound, UDP, child processes);
• "Localhost only" — network block + loopback exemption (CheckNetIsolation) for local services;
• "Internet" — outbound Internet (the internetClient capability);
• "Internet + LAN" — Internet + the local network (privateNetworkClientServer).
